# Minimal run whose only purpose is to DUMP the precomputed cross-section
# table (including the dust median scattering angle, THETA) for the exact
# composition/dust setup used in disc_comparison.par -- NPHOTS kept tiny
# so this finishes almost instantly; the photon count doesn't affect the
# dumped cross-section table, which is computed once up front.

VERBOSE 0
NPHOTS 1000
LENGTH Centimeter

PHYSICS COMPTON OFF
PHYSICS RAYLEIGH OFF
PHYSICS FLUOR OFF
PHYSICS PHOTO ON
PHYSICS DUST_PHOTO ON
PHYSICS DUST_SCAT ON
TEMPERATURE 0

EMSPEC MONO 4900
EMGEOM POINT 0.0 0.0 0.0 0 0 0.05
ECUT 100.0
EGEN 100.0 20000.0

MATTER wilm
METALLICITY 1.0
H2FRACTION 0.0
DUST 0.691

DENSITY 10.0

OBJECT WORLD 5.0e22
OBJECT DISC dustdisc 0.0 0.0 1.542839e22 5.983908e18 9.257033e20

DUMP crosssections.fits
